### Column {width="30%"}

::: {.card title="Tuition Analysis"}

**DePaul's Position**

- **Affordability Rank:** `r depaul_rank_tuition` of `r nrow(tuition_data)` (2nd most affordable)
- **Tuition:** $`r format(depaul_tuition, big.mark=",")`
- **Below Median:** $`r format(abs(depaul_tuition - median_tuition), big.mark=",")` (`r abs(pct_diff_tuition)`%)

**Peer Comparison**

- **Peer Median:** $`r format(median_tuition, big.mark=",")`
- **Range:** $`r format(min_tuition, big.mark=",")` - $`r format(max_tuition, big.mark=",")`
- **DePaul Percentile:** `r depaul_percentile_tuition`th

*Note: University of Connecticut ($`r format(min_tuition, big.mark=",")`) is the only public institution in this peer group; all others are private.*

**Value Proposition**

DePaul is the **2nd most affordable** among 26 peer institutions, offering $`r format(abs(depaul_tuition - median_tuition), big.mark=",")` in savings compared to the median while maintaining comparable quality and urban access.

